┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                           IDENTIFIED GAPS & ISSUES                             │
└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

GAP 1: Supervisor LLM Never Sees Content Signals
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Current: sized_content (raw text) → LLM → agents                    │
│ Missing: content_signals (genre, richness) → LLM                    │
│ Impact: LLM re-discovers what regex already computed in < 50ms      │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

GAP 2: No Feedback Loop from Agent Execution
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Current: supervisor_decision → agents execute → failures logged     │
│ Missing: failures → supervisor learns → better future routing       │
│ Impact: Same bad routing decisions repeated for similar content     │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

GAP 3: Hardcoded 3-Agent Minimum Ignores Genre
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Current: ALWAYS 3 agents (OPINION, TUTORIAL, RESEARCH all same)     │
│ Missing: Genre-aware minimums (OPINION: 1, TUTORIAL: 4, etc.)       │
│ Impact: Forced agents on OPINION content → wasted analysis          │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

GAP 4: Auto-Activation Redundancy with LLM
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Current: LLM selects agents → auto-activation ALSO checks patterns  │
│ Missing: Coordination (is this safety net or duplicate logic?)      │
│ Impact: Unclear responsibility, wasted cycles                        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

GAP 5: No Genre-Aware Agent Prompts
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Current: Same security_auditor prompt for TUTORIAL vs RESEARCH      │
│ Missing: Genre-specific prompt variants (concepts vs metrics)       │
│ Impact: Research content fails specificity (band-aided with 0.15)   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘


