Note: Articles often discuss technical topics (security, performance, implementation)
      so most analytical agents can process "article" content type.
      Only code_quality_critic requires actual parseable code.


┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                           PERFORMANCE CHARACTERISTICS                          │
└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

Signal Detection (detect_content_signals):        < 50ms  (regex patterns)
Content Type Detection (detect_content_type):     < 10ms  (pattern scoring)
Code Pattern Detection (detect_code_patterns):    < 20ms  (regex search)

Supervisor LLM Call (cached):                     < 5ms   (Redis exact-match)
Supervisor LLM Call (uncached, Gemini):           150-250ms (structured output)
Supervisor LLM Call (uncached, GPT-4o-mini):      200-350ms (structured output)

Post-Processing Filters:                          < 30ms  (all rule-based)

Total Supervisor Phase (cached):                  ~100ms
Total Supervisor Phase (uncached):                ~400ms
